{"id": "583d1bb0-378e-4978-bdcb-03b964b2cbce", "slug": "nexus-telemetry", "title": "Nexus Telemetry", "description": "Telemetry Topology Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus Telemetry\"\ndescription: \"Telemetry Topology Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#2DD4BF\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#2DD4BF\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus Telemetry\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 2; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nTelemetry Topology Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNexus Throughput 0.00 gb/s Peak Capacity Node Alpha Optimal Topology Sync Continuous packet synchronization maintaining low-latency harmonization across the primary distributed node network.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Nexus; Topology Sync.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #2DD4BF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #2DD4BF, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus Telemetry</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-8 font-sans antialiased text-white selection:bg-teal-500/20 overflow-hidden m-0 relative\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Animated Dots Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"gl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-1000\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Ambient Grid Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 64px 64px;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- 3D Perspective Stage -->\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-[500px] mx-auto relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center group\" style=\"perspective: 1400px;\">\n\n        <!-- Atmospheric Glow -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-teal-500/10 via-slate-500/5 to-transparent rounded-[2rem] blur-3xl opacity-50 transition duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Transform Card -->\n        <div id=\"tilt-surface\" class=\"relative w-full rounded-[1.75rem] transition-transform duration-300 ease-out will-change-transform shadow-[0_40px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n\n            <!-- Gradient Border Frame -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[1.75rem] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 via-white/5 to-transparent p-[1px] z-0 pointer-events-none mask-image-gradient\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Core Dashboard Panel -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full bg-[#0a0b0e]/90 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-[1.7rem] overflow-hidden flex flex-col shadow-inner\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n\n                <!-- Dynamic Shine -->\n                <div id=\"specular-shine\" class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 z-50 rounded-[1.7rem]\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 50%); mix-blend-mode: overlay;\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Header Banner -->\n                <div class=\"flex border-b border-white/5 h-20\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 px-6 flex items-center relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 fade-in-up\" style=\"transform: translateZ(20px);\">\n                            <h1 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-teal-400 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                                Nexus\n                            </h1>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Status Pulse -->\n                    <div class=\"w-24 border-l border-white/5 relative flex items-center justify-center bg-white/[0.01]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center fade-in-up delay-100\" style=\"transform: translateZ(10px);\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-teal-500/20 animate-[ping_2.5s_cubic-bezier(0,0,0.2,1)_infinite]\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(45,212,191,0.8)]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Main Layout Matrix -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row h-auto sm:h-[320px]\">\n\n                    <!-- Left Column: Analytics & Line Chart -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full sm:w-[45%] border-b sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r border-white/5 flex flex-col bg-gradient-to-br from-transparent to-white/[0.02]\">\n                        <!-- Chart Viewport -->\n                        <div class=\"h-32 sm:h-1/2 border-b border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden p-4 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-white/30 uppercase tracking-widest fade-in-up delay-150 z-10 relative\">Throughput</span>\n\n                            <!-- Animated SVG Line Chart -->\n                            <svg class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[80%] preserve-3d overflow-visible\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                                <defs>\n                                    <linearGradient id=\"chart-fill\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n                                        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"rgba(45,212,191,0.15)\" />\n                                        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"rgba(45,212,191,0)\" />\n                                    </linearGradient>\n                                </defs>\n                                <!-- Area Fill (Fades In) -->\n                                <path d=\"M0,40 L0,25 C15,25 25,35 45,20 C65,5 75,15 100,8 L100,40 Z\" fill=\"url(#chart-fill)\" class=\"transition-opacity duration-1000 ease-out\" id=\"chart-area\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"></path>\n                                <!-- Stroke Line (Draws In) -->\n                                <path id=\"animated-line\" d=\"M0,25 C15,25 25,35 45,20 C65,5 75,15 100,8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2dd4bf\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"drop-shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(45,212,191,0.4)]\"></path>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Metric Readout -->\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 p-5 flex flex-col justify-end relative z-10\">\n                            <div class=\"fade-in-up delay-200\" style=\"transform: translateZ(30px);\">\n                                <div class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-1 flex items-baseline\">\n                                    <span id=\"metric-counter\">0.00</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-lg text-teal-400 font-light ml-1\">gb/s</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs text-white/40 tracking-wide font-normal uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-1\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-up-linear\" class=\"text-teal-500/70\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    Peak Capacity\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Right Column: Context & Metadata -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col relative\">\n                        <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n                        <div class=\"h-10 border-b border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between px-4 font-mono text-xs text-white/40 bg-white/[0.01]\">\n                            <button class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 flex items-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-left-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                            <span class=\"tracking-widest uppercase text-white/50 fade-in-up delay-300\">Node Alpha</span>\n                            <button class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 flex items-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Descriptor Panel -->\n                        <div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center sm:justify-end relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-cloud-linear\" class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 text-6xl text-white/[0.02] pointer-events-none\"></iconify-icon>\n\n                            <div class=\"relative z-10 fade-in-up delay-400\" style=\"transform: translateZ(25px);\">\n                                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-teal-500/20 bg-teal-500/10 mb-4 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(45,212,191,0.05)]\">\n                                    <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-teal-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-teal-300 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]\">Optimal</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-2 leading-snug\">\n                                    Topology Sync\n                                </h2>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                                    Continuous packet synchronization maintaining low-latency harmonization across the primary distributed node network.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Initialization Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        // CSS Setup for staggered fade-ins (avoiding <style> tag)\n        document.querySelectorAll('.fade-in-up').forEach(el => {\n            el.style.opacity = '0';\n            el.style.transform = 'translateY(10px) translateZ(0)';\n            el.style.transition = 'opacity 0.8s ease-out, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1)';\n        });\n\n        window.addEventListener('load', () => {\n            // Trigger Fade-ins\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.fade-in-up').forEach(el => {\n                    const delayClass = Array.from(el.classList).find(c => c.startsWith('delay-'));\n                    const delay = delayClass ? parseInt(delayClass.split('-')[1]) : 0;\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        // Preserve existing 3D transform if present\n                        const currentTransform = el.style.transform;\n                        const zTransform = currentTransform.match(/translateZ\\([^)]+\\)/);\n                        el.style.opacity = '1';\n                        el.style.transform = `translateY(0) ${zTransform ? zTransform[0] : ''}`;\n                    }, delay);\n                });\n            }, 100);\n\n            // Animated SVG Line Drawing\n            const line = document.getElementById('animated-line');\n            const area = document.getElementById('chart-area');\n            const length = line.getTotalLength();\n\n            line.style.strokeDasharray = length;\n            line.style.strokeDashoffset = length;\n\n            // Trigger reflow\n            line.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                line.style.transition = 'stroke-dashoffset 2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)';\n                line.style.strokeDashoffset = '0';\n\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    area.style.opacity = '1';\n                }, 800);\n            }, 500);\n\n            // Metric Counter\n            const counter = document.getElementById('metric-counter');\n            let currentCount = 0;\n            const targetCount = 12.84;\n            const duration = 2000;\n            const start = performance.now();\n\n            const animateValue = (time) => {\n                const elapsed = time - start;\n                const progress = Math.min(elapsed / duration, 1);\n                // Ease out expo\n                const ease = progress === 1 ? 1 : 1 - Math.pow(2, -10 * progress);\n\n                currentCount = ease * targetCount;\n                counter.innerText = currentCount.toFixed(2);\n\n                if (progress < 1) requestAnimationFrame(animateValue);\n            };\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateValue);\n        });\n\n        // 3D Hover Interaction\n        const surface = document.getElementById('tilt-surface');\n        const stage = surface.parentElement;\n        const shine = document.getElementById('specular-shine');\n        const maxTilt = 6;\n\n        stage.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const rect = stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n            const x = (e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width;\n            const y = (e.clientY - rect.top) / rect.height;\n\n            const rotateX = ((0.5 - y) * maxTilt * 2).toFixed(2);\n            const rotateY = ((x - 0.5) * maxTilt * 2).toFixed(2);\n\n            surface.style.transform = `rotateX(${rotateX}deg) rotateY(${rotateY}deg)`;\n\n            shine.style.opacity = '1';\n            shine.style.background = `radial-gradient(circle at ${x * 100}% ${y * 100}%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%)`;\n        });\n\n        stage.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n            surface.style.transform = `rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg)`;\n            shine.style.opacity = '0';\n        });\n\n        // WebGL Interactive Ambient Dots\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const cvs = document.getElementById('gl-canvas');\n            const gl = cvs.getContext('webgl');\n            if (!gl) return;\n\n            const createShader = (type, source) => {\n                const s = gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(s, source);\n                gl.compileShader(s);\n                return s;\n            };\n\n            const prog = gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(prog, createShader(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, 'attribute vec2 p; void main() { gl_Position = vec4(p, 0.0, 1.0); }'));\n\n            // Teal/Slate themed dot matrix shader\n            gl.attachShader(prog, createShader(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, `\n                precision lowp float;\n                uniform vec2 u_res;\n                uniform float u_time;\n                uniform vec2 u_mouse;\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_res;\n                    vec2 st = uv;\n                    st.x *= u_res.x / u_res.y;\n\n                    vec2 m_uv = u_mouse / u_res;\n                    m_uv.y = 1.0 - m_uv.y;\n                    m_uv.x *= u_res.x / u_res.y;\n\n                    vec2 grid = st * 35.0; // Grid density\n\n                    // Slow subtle pan\n                    grid.x -= u_time * 0.1;\n                    grid.y += sin(u_time * 0.05) * 0.2;\n\n                    vec2 gv = fract(grid) - 0.5;\n\n                    float m_dist = length(st - m_uv);\n                    float m_inf = smoothstep(0.5, 0.0, m_dist);\n\n                    float dot_size = 0.04 + (m_inf * 0.06);\n                    float shape = smoothstep(dot_size, dot_size - 0.02, length(gv));\n\n                    vec3 bg = vec3(0.02, 0.02, 0.02);\n                    // Teal/Slate dots\n                    vec3 base_dot = vec3(0.15, 0.20, 0.22);\n                    vec3 glow_dot = vec3(0.17, 0.83, 0.75); // #2dd4bf Teal\n\n                    vec3 color = mix(base_dot, glow_dot, m_inf * 0.8);\n\n                    float vignette = uv.x * uv.y * (1.0 - uv.x) * (1.0 - uv.y);\n                    vignette = smoothstep(0.0, 0.05, vignette);\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(mix(bg, color, shape * vignette), 1.0);\n                }\n            `));\n\n            gl.linkProgram(prog);\n            gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n            const buf = gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1, 1,-1, -1,1, 1,1]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n            const pLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, 'p');\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(pLoc);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(pLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n            const resLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_res');\n            const timeLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_time');\n            const mouseLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_mouse');\n\n            let mx = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            let my = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            window.addEventListener('mousemove', e => { mx = e.clientX; my = e.clientY; });\n\n            const resize = () => {\n                cvs.width = window.innerWidth;\n                cvs.height = window.innerHeight;\n                gl.viewport(0, 0, cvs.width, cvs.height);\n            };\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            const render = (t) => {\n                gl.uniform2f(resLoc, cvs.width, cvs.height);\n                gl.uniform1f(timeLoc, t * 0.001);\n                gl.uniform2f(mouseLoc, mx, my);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n                requestAnimationFrame(render);\n            };\n            requestAnimationFrame(render);\n        };\n        initWebGL();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-telemetry.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-telemetry.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-telemetry-DESIGN.md", "views": 52, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T06:15:20.31984+00:00"}